{"reviews":[{"id":"B07GL2JJZZ-0","r":5.0,"t":"Great holds heat well very smooth and really great stone","x":"I LOVE this tourmaline heart shape because it is perfect for the jaw line and other areas. Learned how to use it by going to you tube and watching tutorials and it really does work. I chose the black tourmaline because when your doing this the stone is meant to be hot/warm not cold as advertised by other sellers. You want the stone to be hot or warm. It holds the Heat very well. I also used Jojoba oil and I saw an immediate noticeable difference in the contours of my face and jaw line. It really","h":40,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B07GL2JJZZ-1","r":5.0,"t":"Perfectly happy with stone and it's performance","x":"It has nice smooth edges. Good shape for the contours of the jawline, cheekbones, forehead, etc.. No rough edges like some other brands. Very pleased! Thank you!","h":9,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B07GL2JJZZ-2","r":2.0,"t":"Could scrape skin","x":"It\u2019s rough around the edges and I\u2019m nervous to use it in case it should scrape my skin.","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B07GL2JJZZ-3","r":5.0,"t":"LOVING IT","x":"Let me start.. I found out about this product the day before I purchased. When looking for Guasha I was looking for an affordable price but a good product. I came along this product and feel in love with it at first time. my favorite color is purple so that was a bonus. I decided to purchase it right away and get the fastest shipping so I could try it. once I recieved it I used it right away. it actually works and I can see a difference In my face.it looks more toned and no skin is saggy. I reco","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B07GL2JJZZ-4","r":4.0,"t":"Beautiful GuaSha Stone","x":"Beautiful stone, works as expected. It is a little on the thinner side so I do worry if I would ever press too hard if it would snap but other than that I love it","h":5,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B07GL2JJZZ-5","r":4.0,"t":"now i get the hype about gua sha","x":"This is a nice gua sha that is not too thin and easy to maneuver over the face. I can't speak to if its made of real stone, but it looks like quartz to me. I watched a couple youtube videos to learn some massaging techniques and I feel like I experienced the benefits right away. It came just bubble wrapped inside a bubble wrap envelope. I would have appreciated a box, or a storing pouch, but I was able to find something at home that works.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B07GL2JJZZ-6","r":5.0,"t":"Nice","x":"Item is just as described.  There are no sharp edges or fragile areas.  I haven\u2019t used another gua sha stone to compare, but I am satisfied with this purchase &  do recommend.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"},{"id":"B07GL2JJZZ-7","r":4.0,"t":"Broken - be careful","x":"This is a great product and have been using for a few months now. However, it's super delicate. I was cleaning my bathroom countertop and dropped it (not far from the surface) and it broke! Just be careful when handling.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B07GL2JJZZ-8","r":5.0,"t":"Just what I need","x":"A nice gua sha tool that doesn\u2019t break the bank. I just started really getting into skin care and facial tools. I enjoy using this. I feel like it\u2019s just as good at those expensive ones, but also I\u2019m still learning.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B07GL2JJZZ-9","r":5.0,"t":"So pretty","x":"I\u2019ve used it everyday since I got it.  Love massaging my face with it. The stone is so pretty & feels nice on my face.  Smooth surface & edges.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B07GL2JJZZ-10","r":5.0,"t":"Beautiful and functional rose quartz guasha","x":"This is a lovely and smooth piece of rose quartz that I use every day to sculpt and tone my face. It has good weight and fits well in my hand.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B07GL2JJZZ-11","r":5.0,"t":"Soothing and lovely","x":"[[VIDEOID:85b91c1021ec89dec424d49f955224a8]] Love this tool! It is soothing to use and the stone is a good quality. Definitely recommend.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B07GL2JJZZ-12","r":5.0,"t":"Worth the price","x":"Good quality. I was expecting it would be smaller and maybe not even a real crystal since it was cheap. But it is a real deal.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2022"},{"id":"B07GL2JJZZ-13","r":5.0,"t":"Love it","x":"I love this for doing facial guasha as I\u2019ve seen on TikTok. I have a lot of lymph fluid in my face and I use this every morning and every night and have seen significant changes. The stone holds both heat and coolness to its surface. It also came packaged well with lots of bubble wrap. I am also planning to give this as a gift for the holidays for my loved ones! Love it!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B07GL2JJZZ-14","r":4.0,"t":"Feels good on your skin with some product!","x":"I like how smooth it is and it just feels good against your skin when you\u2019re rubbing product into your skin. Especially when the stone is cold. I knocked one star bc I really don\u2019t think it does what it claims to do - reduce sagging skin, reduce dark circles under eyes, etc\u2026 I haven\u2019t seen any of that, but that\u2019s ok I still like it a lot!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2023"},{"id":"B07GL2JJZZ-15","r":5.0,"t":"Better than creams.","x":"I use this daily 5 minutes, while watching tv. No amount of creams for dark circles have ever worked.  But this! Is. Great. I use it while the stone is cold and would gently slide on my puffy dark circles.  After a week.  I\u2019m sold!!! Bye bye dark circles.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2023"},{"id":"B07GL2JJZZ-16","r":5.0,"t":"exactly what I hoped for","x":"wow, I love this little heart shaped jade stone. I use it to massage my face whenever I feel dull or tired and always once a day at morning or bedtime. I think they could've charged more for it.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B07GL2JJZZ-17","r":1.0,"t":"Bad.","x":"Pretty disappointed... opened the package to find it was broken. It was wrapped pretty well making me feel like this was broken prior to sending it out. Hope something can be done about this.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B07GL2JJZZ-18","r":5.0,"t":"Love it!","x":"I was surprised at how thick this tool was. It feels very sturdy and I\u2019m looking forward to using it. It would be great if they included a little bag with it, but it\u2019s a great price.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B07GL2JJZZ-19","r":2.0,"t":"Easily breaks :(","x":"mine broke after 4 days of use because it fell in the sink. I would recommend just getting one that is thicker and made of Jade definitely a sturdier material","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B07GL2JJZZ-20","r":2.0,"t":"Chipped Sharp Edge","x":"This Gua sha stone arrived with a chip missing from the side leaving a sharp edge. This could have been tragic if I didn\u2019t see it before using it on my face.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B07GL2JJZZ-21","r":5.0,"t":"A tool to add to the arsenal","x":"Awesome little tool! Clean black and smooth! Works great with serum/lotion/coco oil and I keep it in my mini fridge I got here on amazon! Thanks!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2020"},{"id":"B07GL2JJZZ-22","r":5.0,"t":"Great for TMJ","x":"I love mine! My 2 year old threw it the day it showed up and broke to pieces so I ordered another one and I\u2019m obsessed. Hope I get results soon.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B07GL2JJZZ-23","r":5.0,"t":"Great Facial Massage Tool","x":"Really awesome product. I've been seeing this everywhere on tik tok and it is perfect for contouring the face. Cant wait to see the results","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B07GL2JJZZ-24","r":4.0,"t":"Looks exactly like the picture","x":"Looks exactly like the picture but I didn\u2019t use it much. It\u2019s good quality and I think it could be effective if uses consistently.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2023"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently praise the stone's smooth surface and edges, saying it feels nice on the skin.","cites":[2,7,10,11,15]},{"text":"Many reviewers find the shape works well for facial contours like the jawline and cheekbones.","cites":[1,2,6]},{"text":"Several reviewers describe the stone as holding heat or cold well.","cites":[1,14,15]},{"text":"A few reviewers note the stone is thin or delicate and worry it could break or snap.","cites":[5,8]},{"text":"Some reviewers mention rough edges that could scrape the skin.","cites":[3]}]},"qa":[]}